pve-drs (0.0.1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging: binary package pve-drs, the documentation, the example
    configuration and an autopkgtest that proves the installed command runs
    with only its declared dependencies.
  * Not yet buildable: the specification is complete but src/ is not, so
    dpkg-buildpackage has no Python package to install. The first commit that
    adds code makes this build.

